20. PROJECT LIMITATIONS

The current project has the following limitations:

• No backend services are included.
• No server-side database is included.
• No user login/account system is included.
• No real financial transactions are processed.
• Expense information is intended for demonstration purposes.
• The chatbot uses predefined/rule-based educational responses.
• Calculator results are educational estimates.
• The application does not provide professional financial advice.
• Permanent personal financial record management is not provided.


